|Main Details=Vivilith stands like a monument carved by time itself. Its stony body is etched with ancient runes that pulse faintly with dormant power, and its red eyes burn with silent vigilance. When it moves, the ground trembles — not from rage, but from the weight of its purpose. Vivilith is a guardian of secrets buried deep beneath the earth, and its silence speaks of ages long past. It does not seek battle, but when provoked, it becomes an unstoppable force of nature.

When Vivipere evolves into Vivilith, it sheds its serpentine form and rises as a sentinel of stone. Its body becomes a canvas of ancient runes, and its soul is bound to the earth's forgotten truths. Vivilith does not chase conflict — it waits, watches, and protects.
